<title>USA: USF&amp;G calls all series A pfd shrs.</title>
<headline>USF&amp;G calls all series A pfd shrs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>USF&amp;G Corp Wednesday said it called for redemption on April 14 its $4.10 series A convertible exchangeable preferred stock at a price of $50 per share plus $0.83 in accrued and unpaid dividends.  </p>
<p>USF&amp;G said it has about two million shares of the series A outstanding. The stock was originally issued in July 1986.</p>
